# .gitattributes — iHymns
#
# Exact copies of the shared language policy (MWBM-MEDIA-LANG) and its files.
#
# These files are checked byte for byte against the master copies in
# MWBMPartners/MeedyaSuite-core by tools/media-lang/check_copies.py, which runs
# in CI. A copy whose bytes git has changed no longer matches the master's
# checksum, and the check then fails for a reason that has nothing to do with
# its content. Never edit these files here: change the master and take the new
# version with the checker's --update mode.
#
# What the four settings on each line below do: they stop git itself from
# changing a copy's bytes when it writes or reads the file —
#   -text                    no line-ending conversion (for example on a
#                            Windows checkout with core.autocrlf);
#   -filter                  no clean/smudge filter, even one that a
#                            lower-priority attributes file (a person's own
#                            core.attributesFile, or a broader pattern) would
#                            otherwise apply;
#   -working-tree-encoding   no conversion to another character encoding;
#   -ident                   no expansion of a "$Id$" marker into a checksum.
# What they CANNOT do: a higher-priority setting on someone's own machine —
# their .git/info/attributes — still wins over this file. If that changes a
# copy, the copy checker reports the copy as changed; that is the checker doing
# its job, not a fault in the copy.
docs/standards/media-language-bcp47-policy.md -text -filter -working-tree-encoding -ident
docs/standards/MWBM-MEDIA-LANG.lock -text -filter -working-tree-encoding -ident
docs/standards/data/bcp47-language-data-v1.schema.json -text -filter -working-tree-encoding -ident
tests/fixtures/bcp47-language-policy-v1.json -text -filter -working-tree-encoding -ident
tests/fixtures/bcp47-language-policy-v1.schema.json -text -filter -working-tree-encoding -ident
tools/media-lang/check_copies.py -text -filter -working-tree-encoding -ident
appWeb/public_html/includes/vendor/media-language/MediaLanguagePolicy.php -text -filter -working-tree-encoding -ident
appWeb/public_html/includes/vendor/media-language/bcp47-language-data-v1.json -text -filter -working-tree-encoding -ident
appWeb/public_html/includes/vendor/media-language/README.md -text -filter -working-tree-encoding -ident
appWeb/public_html/includes/vendor/media-language/tests/run-conformance.php -text -filter -working-tree-encoding -ident
